{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-02T13:28:59.386Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"6da2f5f4d31f8f762cde8c96","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1576","claim:pm-urzubi","lineage:pm-urzubi","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1576+pm-urzubi","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1576","claim:pm-urzubi","lineage:pm-urzubi","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.316","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-02T13:28:59.385Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implementation evidence (feat/write-time-preconditions): one expected-revision precondition enforced inside the locked item store. core/store/item-mutation-precondition.ts gained an AsyncLocalStorage revision scope. assertItemMutationPreconditions compares hashDocument(locked document) with the declared item_hash before any write, and advanceItemMutationPreconditions moves it to the scope's own committed revision. Every mutateItem caller, deleteItem and restore (now also advancing) are therefore guarded without per-command wiring, including bulk update-many rows and extension commands that mutate through the SDK. Public SDK: sdk/lifecycle/item-revision.ts (readItemRevision, withExpectedItemRevisions with a checked/unchecked receipt, parseExpectHashSpecs, isItemRevisionConflict, describeItemRevisionChanges), plus PmClient.readItemRevision/withExpectedItemRevisions. Transports: global --expect-hash <item_hash|id=item_hash> (cli/expected-revisions.ts binds after preAction resolves the tracker root and command <id>), and expectHash on SDK runAction/MCP for 19 item-writing actions. pm get reports item_hash (equal to the latest history after_hash), and stdin-json accepts it as a read-only envelope key so get output still round-trips. The refusal item_revision_conflict (exit 4) carries item_id, expected_revision, current_revision (now rendered in the JSON envelope for every compare-and-set refusal) and details.changes_since, the newest 10 history entries with top-level fields. GH-1620: workspace-transaction docs and JSDoc now state that the lock serializes coordinators only. A negative-control spec shows the peer write is lost without the guard and refused with it. Lexicon budgets grow by exactly one inherited host flag (SHARED_HOST_FLAG_GROWTH) with no spare allowance."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-02T13:28:59.386Z"}],"before_hash":"e498b8885cac005a71df06735e41e0bf1562883057256ca18fa252c4abbdc1f7","after_hash":"916566deefd5825e2222907782b1881b9c27c2d09f42647406441fbddc01942f","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"cca3b0aca2280e26fbb24facca5fc70997debd51b200733172f1a928c237e01d"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-02T13:29:25.935Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"6da2f5f4d31f8f762cde8c96","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1576","claim:pm-urzubi","lineage:pm-urzubi","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1576+pm-urzubi","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1576","claim:pm-urzubi","lineage:pm-urzubi","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.316","source":"probe"}},"op":"learning_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-02T13:29:25.935Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/learnings","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-02T13:29:25.935Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"A precondition scoped with AsyncLocalStorage and evaluated inside the locked item store covers every write path (lifecycle, annotations, links, deps, restore, delete, bulk rows, extension commands) without per-command wiring. The scope's checked/unchecked receipt doubles as a detector for declared-but-unread transport parameters: it caught pm-wsqxwb, where pm_comments/pm_files top-level add silently reads."}]}],"before_hash":"916566deefd5825e2222907782b1881b9c27c2d09f42647406441fbddc01942f","after_hash":"f1c4db5b7dca0f3a56e20cb72480d44ecf676480cdba986fe22771116b782257","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"d0f75564de89b8b4933e4823e25e579f2127321169b223a03c0ac1735a0916cd"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-02T13:29:27.511Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"6da2f5f4d31f8f762cde8c96","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1576","claim:pm-urzubi","lineage:pm-urzubi","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1576+pm-urzubi","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1576","claim:pm-urzubi","lineage:pm-urzubi","lineage:pm-33cw","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.316","source":"probe"}},"op":"learning_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/learnings/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-02T13:29:27.511Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Every shared global flag counts toward every command's ratcheted flag-lexicon budget (111 budgets). Adding one host flag means growing all of them by exactly one through SHARED_HOST_FLAG_GROWTH in flag-lexicon-contracts.ts, never by loosening individual ratchets. Global options also leak into update-many's option bag unless invocation-options deletes them."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-02T13:29:27.511Z"}],"before_hash":"f1c4db5b7dca0f3a56e20cb72480d44ecf676480cdba986fe22771116b782257","after_hash":"d4166dfe4d6fd1f29e8a3e44e9e48e9bd1aaa28f51b718a2741872751dedfffb","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"df59941fa6945f3eab463fac903d1f7ea3e04a2c3805ba292c384edd68bb0415"}
